OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer has vaccinated 1,700 sheep
OL,4,Afor bluetongue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer has spoken about the impact of
OL,7,Fprotecting livestock from the
OL,8,Fbluetongue virus which can make sheep
OL,9,Fand cattle lethargic and lame, it can
OL,10,Fcause birth defects or spontaneous
OL,11,Fabortions and it can be fatal.
OL,13,FMark Walter, who farms in Milton
OL,14,FDamerel in north Devon said bluetongue
OL,15,Fhas caused "a lot of stress".
OL,17,FHe said: "I've probably injected 400
OL,18,Fplus sheep with antibiotics. We've
OL,19,Fvaccinated 1,700 sheep in total.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
