OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer has vaccinated 1,700 sheep
OL,4,Afor bluetongue
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon has the highest number of places
OL,7,Fwith the virus in England and Wales,
OL,8,Fwith 304 premises where it has been
OL,9,Fdetected, as of Wednesday, with 105
OL,10,Fsites in Cornwall.
